      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Email Origin Trace",
      "questDescription": "Samira flags an urgent account-security message as a likely phishing attempt. Preserve its raw source, practice removing reversible encoding, then use EmailTrackerPro to inspect the recorded relay path. Treat the final route endpoint as a technical lead, not proof of who authored the message.",
